{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    
    Provide:
    - Liquid
    - HTML
    - CSS
    - JavaScript
    - Shopify schema
    
    The code must be placed in ONE Shopify section file.
    with view all products button and with link 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:100%; box-sizing:border-box; background:{{ block.settings.background }}; color:#14231a; padding:clamp(28px,5vw,64px) 20px; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}:before { content:""; position:absolute; right:-100px; top:-190px; width:480px; height:480px; border-radius:50%; background:repeating-conic-gradient(from 8deg, rgba(255,214,10,.11) 0deg 8deg, transparent 8deg 18deg); pointer-events:none; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width:100%; max-width:1240px; margin:0 auto; position:relative; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:end; gap:20px; margin-bottom:24px; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { margin:0; color:#1f5130; font: 400 clamp(28px,4vw,42px)/1.15 Georgia,serif; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro { margin:8px 0 0; color:#5b6660; font-size:15px; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:12px 19px; border:1px solid #1f5130; border-radius:999px; color:#1f5130; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; white-space:nowrap; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all:hover { background:#1f5130; color:#fff; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__frame { position:relative; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { display:flex; gap:18px; overflow-x:auto; scroll-snap-type:x mandatory; scroll-behavior:smooth; scrollbar-width:none; padding:4px 3px 18px; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar { display:none; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3); min-width:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:{{ block.settings.card_radius }}px; background:#fff; box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(20,45,27,.07); scroll-snap-align:start; transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover { transform:translateY(-4px); box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(20,45,27,.13); }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media { position:relative; overflow:hidden; height:clamp(190px,22vw,280px); background:#f4f2e9; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img { width:100%; height:100%; display:block; object-fit:cover; transition:transform .35s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img { transform:scale(1.035); }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { width:100%; height:100%; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg { display:block; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge { position:absolute; top:12px; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; font-size:11px; line-height:1; font-weight:700; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge--best { left:12px; color:#fff; background:#1f5130; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge--discount { right:12px; color:#14231a; background:#ffd60a; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body { padding:15px 16px 17px; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating { display:inline-flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; color:#315c3a; background:#f1f5e9; border-radius:99px; padding:5px 8px; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { margin:10px 0 4px; font:400 21px/1.2 Georgia,serif; color:#1f5130; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { margin:0; min-height:20px; color:#5b6660; font-size:13px; line-height:1.45; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-top:13px; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price { color:#14231a; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare { margin-left:5px; color:#68736c; font-size:12px; font-weight:400; text-decoration:line-through; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart { flex:0 0 42px; width:42px; height:42px; border:0; border-radius:50%; display:grid; place-items:center; background:#1f5130; color:#fff; cursor:pointer; transition:transform .2s ease,background .2s ease; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart:hover { background:#0d3a1d; transform:scale(1.06); }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart:focus-visible,.ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:focus-visible,.ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #ffd60a; outline-offset:3px; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows { position:absolute; right:-14px; top:42%; display:flex; gap:8px; z-index:2; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { width:44px; height:44px; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid #dce3d8; border-radius:50%; color:#1f5130; background:#fff; cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.09); }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next { color:#fff; border-color:#1f5130; background:#1f5130; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:disabled { opacity:.42; cursor:not-allowed; }
  .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__status { margin-top:8px; color:#5b6660; font-size:13px; min-height:18px; }
  @media(max-width:900px) { .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2); } .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows { right:0; } }
  @media(max-width:600px) { .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding:30px 14px; } .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head { align-items:start; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; } .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex-basis:84%; } .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media { height:250px; } .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows { top:-60px; right:0; } .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { width:38px; height:38px; } }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { scroll-behavior:auto; } .ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card,.ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img,.ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart { transition:none; } }
{% endstyle %}
<plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head"><div><h2 class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}<p class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro">{{ block.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>{% endif %}</div>{% if block.settings.view_all_link != blank %}<a class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all" href="{{ block.settings.view_all_link }}">{{ block.settings.view_all_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__frame"><div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track tabindex="0" aria-label="Plant products carousel">
      {% for i in (1..6) %}
        {% liquid
          assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i
          assign title_key = 'title_' | append: i
          assign desc_key = 'description_' | append: i
          assign price_key = 'price_' | append: i
          assign compare_key = 'compare_price_' | append: i
          assign discount_key = 'discount_' | append: i
          assign best_key = 'bestseller_' | append: i
          assign best_text_key = 'bestseller_text_' | append: i
          assign rating_key = 'rating_' | append: i
          assign reviews_key = 'reviews_' | append: i
          assign link_key = 'link_' | append: i
          assign product_key = 'product_' | append: i
          assign image = block.settings[image_key]
          assign title = block.settings[title_key]
          assign description = block.settings[desc_key]
          assign price = block.settings[price_key]
          assign compare_price = block.settings[compare_key]
          assign discount = block.settings[discount_key]
          assign bestseller = block.settings[best_key]
          assign bestseller_text = block.settings[best_text_key]
          assign rating = block.settings[rating_key]
          assign reviews = block.settings[reviews_key]
          assign link = block.settings[link_key]
          assign selected_product = block.settings[product_key]
          assign card_title = title
          if selected_product != blank
            assign card_title = selected_product.title
          endif
        %}
        {% if card_title != blank or image != blank or selected_product != blank %}
          <article class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" style="background:{{ block.settings.card_background }};">
            <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media">
              {% if image != blank %}<img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | default: card_title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ image.width }}" height="{{ image.height }}">{% elsif selected_product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ selected_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ selected_product.featured_image.alt | default: card_title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ selected_product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ selected_product.featured_image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}
              {% if bestseller %}<span class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge--best">{{ bestseller_text | escape }}</span>{% endif %}{% if discount != blank %}<span class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge--discount">{{ discount | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body"><span class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating" aria-label="Rated {{ rating }} out of 5">★ {{ rating | escape }} <span aria-hidden="true">|</span> {{ reviews | escape }}</span><h3 class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ card_title | escape }}</h3>{% if description != blank %}<p class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ description | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
              <div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom"><div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{% if selected_product != blank %}{{ selected_product.price | money }}{% elsif price != blank %}{{ price | escape }}{% endif %}{% if selected_product != blank and selected_product.compare_at_price > selected_product.price %}<span class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ selected_product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% elsif compare_price != blank %}<span class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ compare_price | escape }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
                {% if selected_product != blank %}<form method="post" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__form"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ selected_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}"><input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><button class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" type="submit" aria-label="Add {{ selected_product.title | escape }} to cart" {% unless selected_product.available %}disabled{% endunless %}><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 13H4L5 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 9V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button></form>{% elsif link != blank %}<a class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" href="{{ link }}" aria-label="View {{ card_title | escape }}"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 13H4L5 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 9V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></a>{% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div><div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows"><button class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous products"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><button class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next products"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button></div></div><div class="ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__status" data-status aria-live="polite"></div>
  </div>
</plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>
(function(){
  const tag='plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
  if(customElements.get(tag)) return;
  class PlantCarousel extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback(){
      this.track=this.querySelector('[data-track]');this.prev=this.querySelector('[data-prev]');this.next=this.querySelector('[data-next]');this.status=this.querySelector('[data-status]');
      if(!this.track)return;
      this.prev.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(-1));this.next.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(1));
      this.track.addEventListener('scroll',()=>this.update(),{passive:true});this.track.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='ArrowRight'){e.preventDefault();this.move(1)}if(e.key==='ArrowLeft'){e.preventDefault();this.move(-1)}});
      this.resizeObserver=new ResizeObserver(()=>this.update());this.resizeObserver.observe(this.track);this.update();
    }
    disconnectedCallback(){if(this.resizeObserver)this.resizeObserver.disconnect()}
    move(direction){const card=this.track.querySelector('.ai-nursery-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card');if(!card)return;const gap=parseFloat(getComputedStyle(this.track).gap)||0;this.track.scrollBy({left:direction*(card.getBoundingClientRect().width+gap),behavior:'smooth'})}
    update(){const max=this.track.scrollWidth-this.track.clientWidth;this.prev.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft<=2;this.next.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft>=max-2;this.status.textContent=this.track.children.length?`${this.track.children.length} plant${this.track.children.length===1?'':'s'} available`:''}
  }
  customElements.define(tag,PlantCarousel);
})();
</script>
